6
00:00:21,221 --> 00:00:25,466
and when a person should take over. In this lesson,

7
00:00:25,466 --> 00:00:29,710
we’ll design a small image-triage pipeline around that real constraint.

8
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:34,791
Start with a narrow, testable goal: identify a short list

9
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:39,873
