10
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:44,954
Do not promise a diagnosis from one photo. Define the

11
00:00:44,954 --> 00:00:50,035
classes with an agronomist, collect examples across farms, phones, lighting,

12
00:00:50,035 --> 00:00:55,117
and growth stages, and record the image’s location and date

13
00:00:55,117 --> 00:00:59,690
only when the user has agreed to that collection.

14
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:04,463
The split matters as much as the model. If near-identical

15
00:01:04,463 --> 00:01:09,237
photos from the same plant land in both training and

16
00:01:09,237 --> 00:01:14,010
test sets, your test score can look excellent while the

17
00:01:14,010 --> 00:01:18,784
model fails on a new farm. Split by farm or

18
00:01:18,784 --> 00:01:23,557
