21
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:35,569
For object detection, each example needs a class and a

22
00:01:35,569 --> 00:01:40,897
bounding box around the visible symptom. Train a baseline detector,

23
00:01:40,897 --> 00:01:46,226
then inspect precision and recall per class. If missing a

24
00:01:46,226 --> 00:01:51,554
severe symptom is costly, monitor recall; if false alarms overwhelm

25
00:01:51,554 --> 00:01:56,883
the field team, monitor precision too. A single overall accuracy

26
00:01:56,883 --> 00:02:02,211
number hides both failure modes. Review the confusion matrix and

27
00:02:02,211 --> 00:02:07,540
