34
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:40,715
A production request can carry an image and a request

35
00:02:40,715 --> 00:02:45,550
ID. Validate file type and size, reject unreadable images, run

36
00:02:45,550 --> 00:02:50,385
inference in a worker, and return the model version with

37
00:02:50,385 --> 00:02:55,220
