41
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:11,417
The useful deliverable is a measured triage workflow: a carefully

42
00:03:11,417 --> 00:03:16,493
split dataset, per-class metrics, a human-review path, and a service

43
00:03:16,493 --> 00:03:21,570
that exposes uncertainty. Start with one crop and one field

44
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:26,646
